  "reasoning": "The defendant forcibly took a passing child, concealed the child, and intended to keep the child for personal adoption. This conduct constitutes the illegal abduction of a minor under Chinese criminal law, i.e., the crime of kidnapping/abducting a child (拐骗儿童罪). No other criminal conduct is described, so the appropriate charge is 拐骗儿童罪.",
